    "detailed_description": "This is a very strange story about a little robot that wakes in a very strange place with a very strange purpose. Everything that surrounds him is really dangerous. He doesn't know why, but something inside is telling him that he should overcome all these traps...<br>But why is he doing this? He doesn't understand what is going on until he gets in a bar.<br>Now he is not a robot anymore...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034700/extras/228ba164cbe3372b9ba376275a5eba43.avif?t=1667842122\" /></div><br><br>So the <strong>basic</strong> concept is:<br><strong><i>The First type of gameplay (platformer)</i></strong> - our hero is locked in the body of a robot and he has to go through all puzzle chambers.<br>Occasionally, he will awaken in his real body. And this is...<br><br><strong><i>The second type of gameplay (adventure/visual novel)</i></strong> - here our hero will interact with other characters. Let's call it a storytelling part of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034700/extras/26c3f50f9b1ddca40a464d26eb41fa39.avif?t=1667842122\" /></div><br><br>- Over <strong>1000 of High-Quality 3DCG</strong>  images;<br>- <strong>Hot girls</strong> are waiting!<br>- <strong>Intriguing </strong>story;<br>- A lot of humor;<br>- Smooth and <strong>animations;</strong><br>- <strong>4-5 </strong>Hours of gameplay;<br>- More than <strong>50 achievements</strong>;<br>- A lot of <strong>minigames</strong> and other cool stuff!<br><u><br><strong>Controls</strong></u><br><br>You can control the character using these keyboard keys:<br><br><strong>A</strong> - <i>Move left;</i><br><strong>D</strong> - <i>Move right;</i><br><strong>Left Mouse Button</strong> - <i>use your pulse (dash);</i><br><strong>Right Mouse Button</strong> - <i>Camera control;</i><br><strong>ESC </strong>- <i>menu</i>.<br><br>The visual novel/adventure aspect of the game is controlled by the mouse.<br><br><strong>P.S.</strong> If minigames are too hard for you, just skip them using <strong>ESC</strong>.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a very strange story about a little robot that wakes in a very strange place with a very strange purpose. Everything that surrounds him is really dangerous. He doesn't know why, but something inside is telling him that he should overcome all these traps...<br>But why is he doing this? He doesn't understand what is going on until he gets in a bar.<br>Now he is not a robot anymore...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034700/extras/228ba164cbe3372b9ba376275a5eba43.avif?t=1667842122\" /></div><br><br>So the <strong>basic</strong> concept is:<br><strong><i>The First type of gameplay (platformer)</i></strong> - our hero is locked in the body of a robot and he has to go through all puzzle chambers.<br>Occasionally, he will awaken in his real body. And this is...<br><br><strong><i>The second type of gameplay (adventure/visual novel)</i></strong> - here our hero will interact with other characters. Let's call it a storytelling part of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034700/extras/26c3f50f9b1ddca40a464d26eb41fa39.avif?t=1667842122\" /></div><br><br>- Over <strong>1000 of High-Quality 3DCG</strong>  images;<br>- <strong>Hot girls</strong> are waiting!<br>- <strong>Intriguing </strong>story;<br>- A lot of humor;<br>- Smooth and <strong>animations;</strong><br>- <strong>4-5 </strong>Hours of gameplay;<br>- More than <strong>50 achievements</strong>;<br>- A lot of <strong>minigames</strong> and other cool stuff!<br><u><br><strong>Controls</strong></u><br><br>You can control the character using these keyboard keys:<br><br><strong>A</strong> - <i>Move left;</i><br><strong>D</strong> - <i>Move right;</i><br><strong>Left Mouse Button</strong> - <i>use your pulse (dash);</i><br><strong>Right Mouse Button</strong> - <i>Camera control;</i><br><strong>ESC </strong>- <i>menu</i>.<br><br>The visual novel/adventure aspect of the game is controlled by the mouse.<br><br><strong>P.S.</strong> If minigames are too hard for you, just skip them using <strong>ESC</strong>.",
